  "description": "So-Seo was always teased by the other rabbit hybrids for the strange black markings that adorned her body when she transformed into her animal form. Convinced by her tribe's words that no suitor could ever love her broken form, she sets off during their mating season to find the one man who can: a dangerous outcast by the name of Yeollyeo The Black Snake. \n\n(Source: Tapas) \n\n*Note: Note: Part of Metatoon's Geumdan Danpyeonseon (금단(禁斷) 단편선) Collection.*",
